<body><p style="font-family:Verdana, sans-serif; font-size:16px; line-height:1.6; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10.6667px; margin-left: 0px; background-"><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif" lang="NL-NL">Het maken van een evaluatieplan helpt om met elkaar de dialoog te voeren over wat en hoe jullie willen evalueren. Het is belangrijk om dit plan op tijd samen te maken. Onderstaand format helpt bij het formuleren van het evaluatieplan.&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><table aria-rowcount="8" data-clean-table="1" style="border-collapse:collapse; width:100%;"><tbody><tr><td style="border:1px solid #ffffff; padding:8px; vertical-align:top;"><p style="font-family:Verdana, sans-serif; font-size:16px; line-height:1.6; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; background-"><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold" lang="NL-NL">Evaluatie doel</span><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></p></td><td style="border:1px solid #ffffff; padding:8px; vertical-align:top;"><p style="font-family:Verdana, sans-serif; font-size:16px; line-height:1.6; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; background-"><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold" lang="NL-NL">Wat evalueren&nbsp;</span><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></p></td><td style="border:1px solid #ffffff; padding:8px; vertical-align:top;"><p style="font-family:Verdana, sans-serif; font-size:16px; line-height:1.6; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; background-"><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold" lang="NL-NL"><